{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK26ManagementOpaqueEnrollmentV18registrationRecordSSvp","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"registrationRecord","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"registrationRecord","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment\/registrationRecord"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Lowercase-hex serialized RFC 9807 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RegistrationRecord"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/managementopaqueenrollment\/registrationrecord"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"registrationRecord","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The client-supplied half of an OPAQUE enrolment, as it appears inside registration \/"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change-password \/ reset-completion \/ bootstrap request bodies. There is no standalone"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"register\/finish"},{"type":"text","text":" endpoint, deliberately. A record can only be created at a moment when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"plaintext password legitimately exists on the client, and every one of those moments is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already an endpoint that takes a password. A free-standing finish would be an endpoint whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only job is to attach a credential to an account, which is a thing worth not having. Kept"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"separate from ["},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CreateOpaqueCredential"},{"type":"text","text":"] because the tenant, the user and the credential"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifier are all decided by the server — a client that could name them could enrol a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record against somebody else’s account."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/managementopaqueenrollment","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ManagementOpaqueEnrollment"}],"title":"ManagementOpaqueEnrollment","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ManagementOpaqueEnrollment"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment/registrationRecord":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment\/registrationRecord","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"registrationRecord"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/managementopaqueenrollment\/registrationrecord","title":"registrationRecord","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Lowercase-hex serialized RFC 9807 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RegistrationRecord"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/A